	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "PCB coil (COIL_TOKEN), the footprint's own copper, a net tie between pads 1 and 2: 4 layers in series (F/In1/In2/B), 7 + 7.02 + 7.5 + 7.46 turns (29.0 in all), r 4.50-11.50 mm (copper edges), 0.60 mm track at 0.853-0.914 mm pitch; L 12.5 uH, R 1.21 ohm (DC, 1 oz, 20 C); 3 layer changes (pads 3-5). Pads 1, 2 at +y, 12.25 mm out; current into pad 1 turns clockwise seen from the top. Keep-out to r 11.80, courtyard r 11.75. Generated by gen/coils.py")
